# "As long as there's a Lesson card in your graveyard" (CR 205.3k, 611.3a): the 1/2 First-Time Flyer is a 2/3 once Entomb puts Accumulate Wisdom
# (a Lesson) into Bot1's graveyard, and stays a 2/3 with a second Lesson there (+1/+1 once, not for each), and is a 1/2 again as Tormod's Crypt
# exiles the graveyard. The Flyer has flying (CR 702.9).

